{
  "id": "JOB.32",
  "number": "32",
  "bookId": "JOB",
  "reference": "Job 32",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "32",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 32"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "32",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elihu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So these three men stopped answering Job, because he was righteous in his own eyes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Elihu son of Barakel the Buzite, of the family of Ram, became very angry with Job for justifying himself rather than God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He was also angry with the three friends, because they had found no way to refute Job, and yet had condemned him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now Elihu had waited before speaking to Job because they were older than he.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But when he saw that the three men had nothing more to say, his anger was aroused.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Elihu son of Barakel the Buzite said:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JOB 32:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"I am young in years,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 32:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and you are old;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JOB 32:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "that is why I was fearful,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 32:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "not daring to tell you what I know.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I thought, 'Age should speak;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 32:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "advanced years should teach wisdom.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But it is the spirit",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "in a person,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 32:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the breath of the Almighty, that gives them understanding.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is not only the old",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "who are wise,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 32:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "not only the aged who understand what is right.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Therefore I say: Listen to me;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 32:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I too will tell you what I know.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I waited while you spoke,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 32:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I listened to your reasoning;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JOB 32:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "while you were searching for words,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I gave you my full attention.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JOB 32:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "But not one of you has proved Job wrong;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 32:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "none of you has answered his arguments.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not say, 'We have found wisdom;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 32:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "let God, not a man, refute him.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Job has not marshaled his words against me,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 32:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and I will not answer him with your arguments.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"They are dismayed and have no more to say;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 32:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "words have failed them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Must I wait, now that they are silent,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 32:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "now that they stand there with no reply?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I too will have my say;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 32:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I too will tell what I know.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I am full of words,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 32:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and the spirit within me compels me;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inside I am like bottled-up wine,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 32:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "like new wineskins ready to burst.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
